{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2022-02-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'LOADSMART RAISES $200 MILLION IN SERIES D FINANCING, REACHING $1.3 BILLION VALUATION', 'text': 'CHICAGO, FEB. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOADSMART, A LEADING FREIGHT TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS CLOSED A $200 MILLION ROUND OF SERIES D FINANCING LED BY SOFTBANK LATIN AMERICA FUND, PART OF THE SOFTBANK GROUP, WITH PARTICIPATION FROM SERIES C INVESTOR FUNDS AND ACCOUNTS MANAGED BY BLACKROCK, RAIL TRANSPORTATION SUPPLIER CSX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CSX), AND GLOBAL ACTIVE ASSET MANAGER JANUS HENDERSON GROUP. THE SIGNIFICANT CASH INFUSION NOW VALUES THE COMPANY AT $1.3 BILLION, MORE THAN THREE TIMES ITS SERIES C VALUATION JUST OVER ONE YEAR AGO.'}